  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8ccc8bdaf924d41a38b587d381985c82, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryManager
  story:
  - name: Waking Up
    sentences:
    - What happened? Why is the lab such a mess?
  - name: WTF
    sentences:
    - What the fuck? Fuck! I need those bandages! I'm losing too much blood!
  - name: What happened!?
    sentences:
    - The plant I was working on attacked me?! How?! There's no indication that something
      like this is even possible! What changed?!
    - The blackout! The plants stopped being exposed to the radiation lamps, triggering
      an immediate growth spurt.
    - As if they were just dormant. But how could they have gained consciousness?!
  - name: Finding Richards Laptop
    sentences:
    - 'I need Richard''s laptop. It''s gotta be here somewhere. '
  - name: House
    sentences:
    - 'He''s laptop has gotta be in the house. '
  - name: The Light
    sentences:
    - 'The light! If it caused this horrible reaction on my arm, maybe it can do
      the same thing to these plants. '
  - name: The Monster
    sentences:
    - Richard is that you?
  - name: Radiation
    sentences:
    - The radiation! It kept the plants from growing uncontrollably before the blackout!
  - name: Richard's Research
    sentences:
    - I can't fucking belive this! I told you not to mix those chemicals until we'd
      done more testing! And you applied them directly to the new strain of plants?1
      FUCK!!!
  - name: My Bedroom
    sentences:
    - My bedroom! The lights are still intact there. If I bait this thing into chasing
      me, I can trap it inside and burn the fucker toa crisp!
  storyState: 0
  fcanvas: {fileID: 0}
  dialoguePanelUI: {fileID: 0}
  storyFinished: 0
